  "details": "There could be a function of the VRChat Camera to record a short video (up to 10 seconds, or more) and be able to post it:\n\n- On their profile page (Maybe a specific amount and VRC+ could expand it)\n\n- On the world's page (So people can see what the world looks like before entering it)\n\n- Maybe a way to show them in world just like prints (a little phone/tablet, possibly a VRC+ function ?)\n\n- A feed of recommended shorts according to an algorithm, in the menu\n\nThere should also be a function to follow people, so you can see their shorts on priority.\n\nFriends should be prioritized automatically.\n\nThe short videos should have a possibility for an upvote and also report button for TOS-noncompliant shorts\n\nThere could be a limit of shorts that a person is able to post everyday and VRC+ could expand this number.\n\nThere is a lot of ways this could go, but I think in general this is a good idea if the amount of traffic is OK.\n\nIt would help discoverability of Worlds and maybe also Avatars.",
